<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Thông báo hệ thống - Nhà Hàng</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <style>
        .error-container {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f0f1a 0%, #1a1a2e 50%, #16213e 100%);
        }
        .error-card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: var(--border-radius-lg);
            padding: 40px;
            max-width: 520px;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
            animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease-out;
        }
        .error-icon {
            font-size: 64px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .error-title {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .error-desc {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            margin-bottom: 28px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .error-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="error-container">
        <div class="error-card">
            <div class="error-icon">⚠️</div>
            <h1 class="error-title">Thông báo hệ thống</h1>
            <p class="error-desc">Đã xảy ra sự cố không mong muốn trong hệ thống. Vui lòng thử lại sau hoặc liên hệ quản trị viên!</p>
            <div class="error-actions">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" onclick="window.history.back()">⬅️ Quay lại</button>
                <a href="/login" class="btn btn-primary">🏠 Trang chủ</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

